ll},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593735815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101591#issuecomment-2593735815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101591","id":2593735815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6amUSH","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T19:08:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T19:08:58Z","body":"For me it just adds the UID as well, like so:\n```\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://khd0w6gqbome\" path=\"res://test.gd\" id=\"1_a202f\"]\n```\nFrom the start","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593735815/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593802197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101591#issuecomment-2593802197","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101591","id":2593802197,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6amkfV","user":{"login":"geowarin","id":1045636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1045636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin","html_url":"https://github.com/geowarin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T19:48:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T20:09:27Z","body":"That's weird.\n\nI have no uid in my tscn file.\n\nHere is what I did:\n\n- I downloaded the editor from the latest gh action build (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/12773670530). I picked `linux-editor-mono` for my test\n- I added a `_sc_` file inside the editor directory to launch it in self-contained mode to avoid any configuration issue (see [the doc](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#self-contained-mode))\n- I deleted the `.godot` file from the existing project\n- I opened the project with the editor\n- Added a new script to the scene\n- saved the scene\n- used `cat main.tscn` to get the content:\n\n```tscn\n[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://bl5d2erorek5n\"]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://main.gd\" id=\"1_ig7tw\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node3D\"]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_ig7tw\")\n```\n\nSo... no uid!\n\nHere is a recording of me doing that:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdb92a0a-f267-4c55-8c74-9fc0a4598bd6","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593802197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593979807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101591#issuecomment-2593979807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101591","id":2593979807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6anP2f","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T21:32:28Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T21:35:57Z","body":"I can reproduce the issue on Linux too with a build from the latest `master` branch (4ce466d7fa79e351d4295d5bb47e3266089c3a59).\n\n@geowarin's steps to reproduce are clear but just to be extra explicit, here's what I did:\n- Create a new project\n- Add Node2D root, save scene\n- Git init and stage everything at that point, to see the diff on next step\n- Add script to that Node2D, save scene\n- Check diff:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/node_2d.tscn b/node_2d.tscn\nindex 1a4db51..154c0ed 100644\n--- a/node_2d.tscn\n+++ b/node_2d.tscn\n@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@\n-[gd_scene format=3 uid=\"uid://dq6l04usaey8m\"]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://dq6l04usaey8m\"]\n+\n+[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://node_2d.gd\" id=\"1_wtcfe\"]\n \n [node name=\"Node2D\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n+script = ExtResource(\"1_wtcfe\")\n```\n\nNo UID is written for the `ext_resource`.\n\nClosing the editor, committing the changes, and then reopening the editor and saving the scene, then fixes the issue:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/node_2d.tscn b/node_2d.tscn\nindex 154c0ed..25d019e 100644\n--- a/node_2d.tscn\n+++ b/node_2d.tscn\n@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n [gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://dq6l04usaey8m\"]\n \n-[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://node_2d.gd\" id=\"1_wtcfe\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://cka75sbnaxuto\" path=\"res://node_2d.gd\" id=\"1_wtcfe\"]\n \n [node name=\"Node2D\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n script = ExtResource(\"1_wtcfe\")\n```\n\nI don't think it's a regression though, for me this has always been hit and miss and one of my main gripes with UIDs since 4.0. I hoped we had fixed this as part of the push for generalizing UIDs but it seems we're still missing some cases.\n\nI suspect it's an issue of the open scene not being \"notified\" somehow of the UID of its external resource once it's created. While when it's loaded from disk, it properly parses the `.uid` file and it's part of the scene state I suppose.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593979807/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593985728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101591#issuecomment-2593985728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101591","id":2593985728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6anRTA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T21:35:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T21:35:53Z","body":"The UID for script is probably generated too late or not properly picked up by the editor. As a workaround you can restart the project and the UID should load and save properly.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593985728/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]